Mon Aug 17 19:00:00 UTC 2026 - Lyra OS Release <rodrigo@w3ti.com.br>

- Package upstream LinuxToys 6.6.2 from the fixed release tarball.
- Disable curl-pipe-shell and git-pull self-update paths; updates are
  delivered exclusively through Zypper and the signed Lyra OBS repository.
- Remove upstream bytecode caches so the RPM is independent of the Python
  minor version used to assemble the upstream archive.
